OL,3,GNEWSAMcDonald's AI-generated mural
OL,4,Ariddled with errors
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn AI-generated mural at a town's
OL,7,FMcDonald's restaurant contained errors
OL,8,Fincluding an image of the wrong
OL,9,Fcathedral and town hall as well as a
OL,10,Fmisspelt Premier League champions
OL,11,Fposter.
OL,13,FStaff at the fast food outlet in
OL,14,FBlackburn town centre created the
OL,15,Fposter with AI to highlight some of the
OL,16,FLancashire town's sights and claims to
OL,17,Ffame.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
