OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMcDonald's AI-generated mural
OL,4,Ariddled with errors
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever AI put in a cathedral from
OL,7,FLiverpool as well as a poster
OL,8,Fproclaiming Blackburn Rovers as
OL,9,F"crampions" to celebrate the side
OL,10,Fwinning the Premier League title in
OL,11,F1995.
OL,13,FA McDonald's spokesperson said it would
OL,14,Fnow commission a local artist to create
OL,15,Fa new mural at its King William Street
OL,16,Frestaurant but "perhaps with a little
OL,17,Fmore accuracy".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
